id: pm-gh1371
title: "GH-1371: compose output budget and producer pagination"
description: "Implement existing GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1371. Presentation-only universal output controls must not alter producer fingerprints; every emitted count must match its delivered rows."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-01T09:24:20.761Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T12:23:05.764Z"
