completed_at: "2026-10-02T12:23:04.949Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Advertised output and producer cursors retrieve every matching ID;Continued focus collections have no duplicated IDs;Delivered counts and hidden status receipts agree with emitted rows;Population and count-only totals remain intact;CLI and SDK filter changes reject cursors and field projection remains compatible
parent: pm-doxj
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Retrieve every selected list/search/context row across producer and output cursors with truthful counters, strict collection-specific duplicate checks and documented same-page companions; retain fast versus clean-install boundary ownership."
expected_result: "Advertised producer and output-budget continuations retrieve every selected list/search/context row exactly under their documented companion rules, including blocked fallback focus; delivered counters and omission receipts describe the actual serialized population, and real clean package consumers satisfy the same public SDK contracts."
actual_result: "Temporary consumers retrieve30 list rows,30 search rows and26 context rows through both continuation types with no losses; high/low/blocked fixture collectors and package consumers pass. The earlier separate clean production installation proved58 dependencies, nine direct dependencies, no repository dependency links and11 SDK continuation scenarios; it predates startup-only corrections and is not relabeled as a fresh final installation. Final corrected source: producing receipt test-local-muqw5il0-81bh9y passes 9591 cases, zero failures, two Windows-only skips and exact100/100/100/100 across760 coverage files (lines63301, statements66369, functions13726, branches50811 all fully covered; summarySHA256 80c472e674c90ef42cdb09b8806ed9a5a5729af294f6679afc33f11d5329401c). All1452 frozen authoring/config/test/doc digests remain unchanged. Focused seven-owner228-case CLI/SDK contracts and temporary manual current-artifact acceptance pass. Canonical type/ESLint/SDK-boundary proof passes; complete static prefix passes source/docs/duplicates/contracts/error catalogs/workflow/agent-context47/gate-registry/public-surface checks. Node24.12 official SDK import admission passes. Matched official CLItransport baseline16bb/current controls both pass all six unchanged latency/RSS budgets with10 measured samples per command; no cause for earlier failed samples is established. Canonical test-local-muqxn5c3-9l1c4s passes graph-composition9 assertions (prose gaps1236 at unchanged ceiling), record-integrity1 assertion and bounded mutation329 killed/336 with seven existing declared equivalents. Failed coverage/performance/static attempts remain failed. Current context/package receipt test-local-muqt3kve-ua5tys passes58 token/context surfaces,89 package-first commands, nine packed npx/bunx packages and artifact19981526<20000000bytes. Registrypositive164/164 members across55 lineages/112edges passes; synthetic unregistered two-member negativecontrol correctly fails. This closes verified implementation for the reviewed PR; exact final-head hosted reviews/checks, merge, main workflows and registry publication remain separate pending stages."
