learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T05:56:48.681Z","harness:codex","Delivered context counts cover all high_level, low_level and blocked_fallback rows. Companion rows may repeat only outside the advertised resumed collection within one producer page; do not hide arbitrary duplicates behind a Set. A fast packed-export test can share installed dependency resolution when a distinct mandatory clean-install gate proves the manifest boundary; keep both results explicit."
